WEBVTT

01:44.437 --> 01:45.438
It was here…

01:48.483 --> 01:49.484
From here…

01:52.403 --> 01:53.696
Se-yeon…

01:57.742 --> 01:58.618
I know.

01:59.369 --> 02:00.286
Se-yeon…

02:06.376 --> 02:07.210
I know.

02:09.045 --> 02:10.380
I understand.

02:50.628 --> 02:51.671
Here.

02:58.761 --> 02:59.637
Are you all right?

03:01.973 --> 03:04.684
Why are you asking me?
I should be the one to ask you.

03:09.898 --> 03:10.857
I'm all right.

03:11.941 --> 03:13.276
You're not all right.

03:14.110 --> 03:16.696
I know you're hurting so much
that you can't even breathe.

03:18.239 --> 03:19.657
I guess you remember.

03:20.366 --> 03:21.826
Why didn't you tell me?

03:22.452 --> 03:23.870
You could've told me earlier.

03:25.997 --> 03:26.873
Right.

03:27.999 --> 03:29.250
Why didn't I do that?

03:31.753 --> 03:33.796
That day, when I was here…

03:36.132 --> 03:37.717
I wasn't going to kill myself.

03:42.430 --> 03:44.265
So there's no need for your pity.

03:44.349 --> 03:45.725
I didn't mean it like that--

03:45.808 --> 03:46.893
Fire!

03:46.976 --> 03:48.853
Fire! Everyone evacuate!

03:55.985 --> 03:57.153
Is it a big fire?

03:57.237 --> 03:58.196
There's a fire!

03:59.072 --> 04:00.031
What do we do?

04:00.865 --> 04:02.450
I don't want to die here.

04:02.533 --> 04:04.744
What do we do? There's a fire!

04:11.042 --> 04:12.293
What do we do now?

04:13.461 --> 04:17.048
One household was grilling
some dried pollock,

04:17.715 --> 04:21.302
and the smoke set off the fire alarm…

04:21.386 --> 04:23.554
Why were they grilling
dried pollock at home?

04:23.638 --> 04:26.474
They taste best
when grilled over coals, right?

04:26.557 --> 04:28.643
Jeez. Get out of my way!

04:28.726 --> 04:29.978
- Stop pushing!
- What are you doing?

04:30.061 --> 04:31.396
- I'm going first. Move!
- What?

04:31.479 --> 04:32.522
Really?

04:33.481 --> 04:35.775
What are we doing
in the middle of the night?

04:40.238 --> 04:41.531
Don't kid yourself.

04:41.614 --> 04:43.783
I was only being nice
because I pitied you.

04:47.203 --> 04:49.664
Why did I even come running to him?

05:09.058 --> 05:10.226
Does Ju-kyung know?

05:11.436 --> 05:12.854
That you killed your friend?

05:17.066 --> 05:17.942
Never forget.

05:19.235 --> 05:21.112
You killed Se-yeon,

05:22.530 --> 05:24.157
and you don't deserve to smile.

05:35.835 --> 05:37.420
Someone told me

05:38.463 --> 05:41.549
that tears cleanse the heart.

05:44.135 --> 05:45.470
I'm just saying…

05:47.680 --> 05:49.807
that it's all right to cry sometimes.

05:51.726 --> 05:54.228
You don't have to act like
everything is all right.

05:58.316 --> 05:59.692
Bye.

06:27.178 --> 06:28.930
But now it's bothersome and annoying.

06:29.847 --> 06:30.932
I no longer…

06:31.641 --> 06:33.893
want to care about you anymore, so leave.

06:33.976 --> 06:36.395
I never realized,
but you're meddlesome yourself.

06:36.479 --> 06:37.772
I never asked you to look after me.

06:37.855 --> 06:39.232
I never asked you to care for me.

06:39.816 --> 06:41.400
I won't bother you anymore,

06:41.484 --> 06:43.569
so you can stop your pity.

07:05.550 --> 07:06.759
Are you just getting home?

07:12.849 --> 07:15.393
- Why did you come unannounced?
- Dinner?

07:15.476 --> 07:16.769
I had it, so you can leave.

07:16.853 --> 07:19.147
Turning me away on the spot
when it's been a while?

07:20.106 --> 07:23.151
Your homeroom teacher called
about a parent-teacher conference.

07:23.234 --> 07:26.571
Look, it's Lee Ju-hun!
I can't believe this!

07:28.239 --> 07:29.740
You can't take pictures.

07:29.824 --> 07:30.992
I'm sorry.

07:31.075 --> 07:32.160
Let's go.

07:33.244 --> 07:36.122
Don't worry about
the parent-teacher conference.

07:36.873 --> 07:38.082
I'll tell him you're busy.

07:38.166 --> 07:39.542
I already moved things around.

07:40.209 --> 07:43.212
What do I have to bring
to a parent-teacher conference?

07:44.130 --> 07:46.174
It's my first time, so I'm nervous.

07:46.257 --> 07:48.092
I told you, I don't want people to know.

07:48.176 --> 07:51.721
The teachers already know you are my son.

07:51.804 --> 07:54.140
What would they think
if I don't visit even once?

07:54.223 --> 07:55.558
Just do as you've always done.

07:56.559 --> 07:58.561
I need to rest. Please leave for today.

08:24.295 --> 08:25.171
I'm home.

08:25.838 --> 08:26.881
Hey.

08:27.798 --> 08:29.175
- Is Mom asleep?
- Yes.

08:30.009 --> 08:32.345
- That looks delicious.
- Make your own!

08:32.428 --> 08:34.972
I will, but just one bite. Come on.

08:39.227 --> 08:40.561
You call that one bite?

08:40.645 --> 08:42.313
This is good. Make another one.

08:42.396 --> 08:44.524
You make your own, okay?

08:45.066 --> 08:46.734
You are so petty.

08:49.153 --> 08:50.613
Are you even my sister?

08:52.031 --> 08:53.824
I'm not used to you wearing makeup.

08:53.908 --> 08:55.660
Ju-kyung put a lot of effort into it,

08:55.743 --> 08:57.245
so I can't bring myself to remove it yet.

08:57.328 --> 08:58.371
By the way,

08:58.454 --> 09:00.873
when you said she helped you
when you were in trouble,

09:01.666 --> 09:02.542
what did you mean?

09:03.376 --> 09:04.835
Some kids were bullying me

09:04.919 --> 09:06.796
because they were jealous I got the solo…

09:07.463 --> 09:08.714
They were bullying you?

09:09.298 --> 09:11.717
- What are their names?
- Why? So you can go after them?

09:11.801 --> 09:14.262
Don't you dare! That's embarrassing.

09:14.804 --> 09:16.973
And Ju-kyung already kicked their butts.

09:18.432 --> 09:19.433
She did?

09:20.351 --> 09:21.686
She sure is foolhardy.

09:28.067 --> 09:29.318
That was so good.

09:29.402 --> 09:31.070
You're a good cook.

09:31.153 --> 09:32.071
It was refreshing.

09:32.738 --> 09:33.864
It really tasted great.

09:34.699 --> 09:36.075
Seo-jun!

09:36.158 --> 09:39.579
This was the last pack
of my favorite instant noodles!

10:01.559 --> 10:04.353
Hey, feet, why did you just turn around?
Why won't you stop?

10:04.437 --> 10:05.646
What about school?

10:06.981 --> 10:07.940
Going somewhere?

10:08.608 --> 10:11.360
What? I'm going to school.
Where else would I go?

10:17.033 --> 10:19.035
What now? Why?

10:19.785 --> 10:22.496
You going to tease me again with,
"I'll only listen to you"?

10:23.748 --> 10:25.041
No, that's not it…

10:25.124 --> 10:28.169
- "I'll only listen to you"!
- I'll only listen to you.

10:28.252 --> 10:29.837
Come on! You said it wasn't that!

10:31.047 --> 10:33.466
I'm not going to just take it
if you keep teasing me.

10:34.050 --> 10:35.635
I'll make sure to get you back.

10:39.221 --> 10:41.641
- Han Seo-jun!
- Han Seo-jun!

10:41.724 --> 10:42.850
Why did you butt in?

10:42.933 --> 10:45.186
- "I'll make sure to get you back"!
- "I'll only listen to you"!

10:45.269 --> 10:47.605
"I'll only listen to you"!

10:48.814 --> 10:49.899
- Kang Su-jin.
- Yes.

10:49.982 --> 10:52.109
- My grades are awful.
- Same here.

10:52.193 --> 10:53.486
- Kim Si-hyun.
- Yes.

10:54.612 --> 10:56.322
- Su-ah.
- Yes.

10:58.199 --> 10:59.742
- Kang-hyun.
- Yes.

10:59.825 --> 11:01.035
LEVEL SEVEN

11:01.118 --> 11:02.161
What?

11:02.244 --> 11:04.622
The score is even lower
than the anticipated results.

11:05.623 --> 11:08.501
2ND PLACE OUT OF 25 TOTAL

11:10.836 --> 11:11.879
This is bad.

11:13.339 --> 11:15.716
"What flower blooms without swaying?"

11:16.467 --> 11:18.552
"The beautiful flowers of the world

11:18.636 --> 11:20.012
all bloomed while swaying."

11:20.596 --> 11:21.889
Likewise,

11:21.972 --> 11:24.558
try not to dwell too much
on the results you got today.

11:24.642 --> 11:27.853
Come on, sir. Please stop.

11:27.937 --> 11:30.064
- Seriously, please.
- Sir.

11:30.147 --> 11:32.900
Why do the winds of my life
blow so strongly?

11:32.983 --> 11:35.277
Hyun-kyu, for you,
dwelling might do you some good.

11:36.320 --> 11:39.115
As you all know,
parent-teacher conferences start today.

11:39.198 --> 11:40.658
If any parents coming today

11:40.741 --> 11:42.868
need to reschedule,
make sure to let me know.

11:42.952 --> 11:44.829
- Yes.
- Yes.

11:48.290 --> 11:49.250
I'm almost at school.

11:50.126 --> 11:51.419
I'm done for.

11:52.586 --> 11:55.589
Yes, ma'am. So if you would look here,

11:57.341 --> 11:59.218
it's a lucky number.

11:59.301 --> 12:01.470
Does she think she's
Genghis Khan or Wang Geon?

12:01.554 --> 12:04.014
She didn't have to unify her grade
across all subjects.

12:04.849 --> 12:06.142
Adjusting after the transfer

12:06.225 --> 12:08.519
seems to have left her
less prepared for the exams.

12:09.061 --> 12:09.937
Well…

12:10.521 --> 12:11.730
She won't be able to go

12:12.231 --> 12:14.608
to colleges in Seoul
with these grades, right?

12:15.651 --> 12:17.236
Yes. I mean, no.

12:17.319 --> 12:18.446
This is so upsetting.

12:18.529 --> 12:20.781
But it's not too late.

12:20.865 --> 12:24.577
Starting now, she can still
work on her grades…

12:29.790 --> 12:30.666
Ma'am!

12:35.838 --> 12:36.672
Did you…

12:37.923 --> 12:39.091
see that?

12:40.843 --> 12:43.304
What was there to see?

12:46.432 --> 12:48.684
It's okay. You can overcome this.

12:49.810 --> 12:51.604
It's possible to overcome?

13:04.867 --> 13:07.620
"Eyebrows for men and women.
Semi-permanent eyebrow tattoos."

13:14.084 --> 13:15.377
TEACHERS' LOUNGE

13:20.883 --> 13:21.800
Mom!

13:38.234 --> 13:39.485
Oh, my goodness!

13:39.568 --> 13:40.444
Is that Lee Ju-hun?

13:40.528 --> 13:41.737
- Amazing!
- Isn't that Lee Ju-hun?

13:41.820 --> 13:43.572
That's him. What's he doing here?

13:43.656 --> 13:45.199
Goodness!

13:48.577 --> 13:51.789
I was blinded, so I thought
someone had turned on the lights.

13:51.872 --> 13:54.208
Turns out it was you.

13:54.291 --> 13:56.210
Hello, I'm Soo-ho's homeroom teacher.

13:57.586 --> 13:59.588
Nice to meet you. I'm Soo-ho's dad.

13:59.672 --> 14:02.841
Mr. Han, it's not right
to make Korea's biggest star

14:02.925 --> 14:04.343
come all the way to the school!

14:04.426 --> 14:07.263
You should have conducted a home visit!
Apologize to him.

14:07.346 --> 14:08.180
Apologize now!

14:08.764 --> 14:09.890
I'm sorry for… What?

14:09.974 --> 14:10.891
It's all right.

14:10.975 --> 14:12.810
I've been curious about my son's school.

14:12.893 --> 14:13.936
Mom!

14:14.019 --> 14:15.354
Is this the guidance office?

14:15.437 --> 14:17.106
Yes. Come this way.

14:17.189 --> 14:18.816
"I'll buy you with my money!"

14:23.070 --> 14:26.115
I'm a huge fan of Love Maze.

14:27.283 --> 14:29.076
Can I get your autograph here?

14:31.203 --> 14:33.539
- I love you.
- Can I get one too?

14:33.622 --> 14:35.249
- Can I also get…
- Sure.

14:35.332 --> 14:36.333
I'm the music teacher here.

14:36.417 --> 14:38.002
- Can I get one too?
- But this…

14:38.085 --> 14:40.379
- It's a report card.
- Please.

14:41.547 --> 14:43.632
- I've been your fan forever.
- Goodness!

14:43.716 --> 14:44.633
Take it.

14:44.717 --> 14:45.801
My turn.

14:47.636 --> 14:48.470
Mom.

14:48.554 --> 14:50.890
- You know your movie…
- I teach music here…

14:54.727 --> 14:56.604
Lee Soo-ho, Lee Soo-ho

14:56.687 --> 14:59.106
Hey, Soo-ho, hey, Soo-ho

14:59.189 --> 15:00.566
What are you doing?

15:00.649 --> 15:02.401
Seriously?

15:02.484 --> 15:04.612
We were comrades on the basketball court.

15:04.695 --> 15:07.239
That was an NBA-level set play.

15:13.579 --> 15:15.247
- You?
- Hey, this is huge!

15:15.331 --> 15:16.415
- What?
- Hey, Soo-ho!

15:16.498 --> 15:18.584
Your dad is Lee Ju-hun?

15:18.667 --> 15:20.002
- What?
- The famous Lee Ju-hun?

15:20.085 --> 15:21.545
Yes, Lee Ju-hun the celebrity!

15:21.629 --> 15:22.504
What? That's crazy!

15:22.588 --> 15:24.548
Wait, seriously?

15:24.632 --> 15:25.925
Lee Ju-hun?

15:26.008 --> 15:28.010
People saw him
outside the guidance office.

15:28.093 --> 15:30.220
That's crazy, Soo-ho.

15:30.304 --> 15:31.680
My mom's a huge fan.

15:31.764 --> 15:33.933
Can I ask for his autograph--

15:35.142 --> 15:36.352
- Hey…
- Seriously?

15:36.852 --> 15:39.730
The genes do carry, I see.

15:39.813 --> 15:41.815
- Be quiet already.
- He said he didn't have a family.

15:41.899 --> 15:43.567
Kangsu, did you know?

15:44.944 --> 15:47.196
Soo-ho hates people finding out.

15:47.863 --> 15:49.490
So that's why he didn't tell us.

15:50.157 --> 15:52.076
Lee Ju-hun is the CEO
of Move Entertainment.

15:52.159 --> 15:53.661
Soo-ho's basically an heir to the empire.

15:54.244 --> 15:56.330
I always wondered
why he snubbed other people.

15:56.413 --> 15:58.666
Turns out he belongs to
a totally different world.

15:59.333 --> 16:00.250
Indeed.

16:01.168 --> 16:02.461
He's from a different world.

16:02.544 --> 16:04.713
Right. Didn't Lee Ju-hun's wife pass away?

16:04.797 --> 16:06.340
- So Soo-ho doesn't have a--
- Hey.

16:06.423 --> 16:08.926
Stop with the nonsense,
shut up, and eat your lunch.

16:13.472 --> 16:15.432
- Soo-ho is the top of the school.
- Hello.

16:15.516 --> 16:17.559
He is a model student, a good sportsman,

16:17.643 --> 16:20.145
and a handsome youth,
just like his father.

16:20.229 --> 16:22.022
I couldn't find a flaw even if I tried.

16:22.564 --> 16:23.691
Is that so?

16:23.774 --> 16:25.150
Then I'll see you again.

16:25.234 --> 16:27.611
- Of course, thanks for coming.
- Lee Ju-hun's here.

16:27.695 --> 16:29.405
- Look. It's Lee Ju-hun.
- Lee Ju-hun?

16:29.488 --> 16:31.281
- It's true.
- You're so good-looking!

16:31.365 --> 16:33.200
- You're so handsome!
- He's a celebrity!

16:33.283 --> 16:34.910
- Come on, take a picture.
- Hurry.

16:34.994 --> 16:36.954
- Hurry up and take it.
- Wait a second.

16:37.037 --> 16:38.414
Take one for me too!

16:39.415 --> 16:42.126
- It's true!
- He's so good-looking!

16:42.209 --> 16:43.419
You're so handsome!

16:45.546 --> 16:46.964
Where did she go?

16:50.551 --> 16:52.052
Did you have a good talk?

16:52.886 --> 16:53.846
Yes.

16:55.014 --> 16:56.849
- Hey, Soo-ho.
- Why did you come?

16:56.932 --> 16:58.517
Looks like it's lunchtime.

16:58.600 --> 17:00.894
- Did you have lunch?
- I told you not to come here.

17:01.562 --> 17:03.355
Don't you think it's brazen of you

17:04.273 --> 17:05.691
to do this after all these years?

17:06.900 --> 17:08.819
Mr. Lee!

17:08.902 --> 17:12.239
- Mom, why are you still here?
- I met with Ju-young's teacher too.

17:12.322 --> 17:13.615
Go on. Get in the car.

17:13.699 --> 17:14.908
But Mr. Lee is over there!

17:14.992 --> 17:15.951
Mr. Lee!

17:16.035 --> 17:17.077
Mom!

17:18.203 --> 17:20.539
- We meet again.
- Yes.

17:23.292 --> 17:25.377
This must be your son.

17:25.961 --> 17:29.256
You have a handsome son over there.

17:30.966 --> 17:32.176
Is that right?

17:33.469 --> 17:35.429
You're in the same class as Soo-ho, right?

17:36.805 --> 17:38.557
Yes. Hello.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.767
Excuse me.

17:46.398 --> 17:48.817
Does he have an attitude in school too?

17:49.860 --> 17:50.861
Yes, well…

17:50.944 --> 17:51.904
Maybe a little?

17:52.488 --> 17:55.157
- Let's go, Mom. Come on.
- Let go of me.

17:55.240 --> 17:58.911
I thought it was a shame
to only get your autograph earlier.

17:59.495 --> 18:01.288
Can I get a picture with you, please?

18:17.179 --> 18:18.013
Did you have to…

18:19.056 --> 18:20.474
abandon Se-yeon like that?

18:21.433 --> 18:22.976
Do you think I'm the one to blame?

18:23.060 --> 18:23.894
Seo-jun.

18:24.394 --> 18:25.896
You're not the only one grieving.

18:25.979 --> 18:27.481
He was so helpless!

18:28.982 --> 18:31.151
You could have shielded him from it all!

18:31.235 --> 18:32.945
Where are your manners?

18:34.571 --> 18:37.991
Do I look like a philanthropist
who takes care of helpless kids?

18:40.702 --> 18:42.663
How is it a problem
to apply company policy

18:42.746 --> 18:44.957
to an artist who raised a scandal?

18:51.672 --> 18:54.716
You should have come instead of Mom.

18:55.467 --> 18:58.637
Rip up my nationwide exam report card
when Mom gets home, okay?

19:00.681 --> 19:01.849
Spicy pork?

19:03.100 --> 19:05.185
Okay. Make sure it's spicy.

19:05.894 --> 19:07.396
Sure. I love you, Dad.

19:07.938 --> 19:08.772
Bye!

19:11.108 --> 19:12.568
Kangsu.

19:13.068 --> 19:14.778
Why rip up your report card?

19:14.862 --> 19:17.656
My mom got Lee Ju-hun's autograph
on my report card.

19:18.448 --> 19:19.867
On the front or the back?

19:20.534 --> 19:21.368
The front.

19:22.035 --> 19:23.829
That is upsetting.

19:24.413 --> 19:28.250
Anyhow, my dad is the only person
who cares about me in my family.

19:28.333 --> 19:30.127
Why? Because he makes you spicy pork?

19:34.131 --> 19:35.716
You must be close with him.

19:35.799 --> 19:36.633
Lucky you.

19:36.717 --> 19:38.802
You think I'm lucky
when my dad's out of a job?

19:39.344 --> 19:41.889
You think I'm lucky
when he somehow cost us our home?

20:10.125 --> 20:11.418
Mom, this is embarrassing.

20:11.501 --> 20:12.836
You look horrible here.

20:13.337 --> 20:14.671
My face hardly matters.

20:14.755 --> 20:15.589
What matters

20:16.173 --> 20:17.925
is Ju-hun looks good in the picture.

20:18.008 --> 20:22.095
But the camera doesn't do him justice.

20:22.596 --> 20:24.223
His face was glowing, you know.

20:26.767 --> 20:31.063
This back-alley Adonis
and the nation's heartthrob

20:31.146 --> 20:32.856
stand on entirely different levels.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.155
Still.

20:40.781 --> 20:43.825
How could you get an autograph
on your daughter's report card?

20:43.909 --> 20:44.910
This is a report card?

20:45.577 --> 20:48.121
It needs decent grades to count as one.
How embarrassing.

20:48.830 --> 20:49.748
Ju-young,

20:50.457 --> 20:53.835
cover Ju-kyung's name so it can't be seen.

20:55.128 --> 20:56.546
All sevens.

20:56.630 --> 20:57.881
LEVEL SEVEN

20:57.965 --> 20:59.883
LIM JU-KYUNG

20:59.967 --> 21:01.593
She sure has bought a lot.

21:02.344 --> 21:05.389
You may be her mom,
but you're crossing the line here.

21:05.472 --> 21:06.723
Stop right there.

21:08.308 --> 21:10.394
Who are you trying to fool?

21:13.272 --> 21:16.608
This is the only way
for her to snap out of it.

21:21.280 --> 21:23.115
- I'm home.
- Ju-kyung…

21:25.450 --> 21:26.285
Mom.

21:27.411 --> 21:28.704
Isn't that my makeup?

21:28.787 --> 21:29.621
Yes.

21:30.330 --> 21:31.498
I'm throwing it all away.

21:31.581 --> 21:32.958
But I haven't used them up.

21:33.041 --> 21:35.294
Should I throw you away
even though you're not grown up yet?

21:36.586 --> 21:39.298
Please, not the makeup.
These are my lifelines.

21:39.381 --> 21:40.841
I'll make sure I rank 20 places…

21:40.924 --> 21:43.510
No, 30 places higher this time.
Come on, please?

21:44.011 --> 21:46.179
Please tell me something that makes sense.

21:46.722 --> 21:48.849
Come on, Mom. Please?

21:56.606 --> 21:57.983
Losing is also a bad habit.

21:58.066 --> 21:59.651
And a bad habit must be fixed.

21:59.735 --> 22:02.446
I didn't invest in you
to see this kind of report card!

22:02.529 --> 22:04.781
If you can't beat
the son of such a lowly family,

22:04.865 --> 22:07.367
how do you expect to get into
a medical school in Seoul?

22:35.562 --> 22:38.356
You had it rough, my darlings.

22:39.107 --> 22:41.193
I'll keep you safe no matter what.

22:45.655 --> 22:47.741
Why do I still have this?

22:55.457 --> 22:57.542
A friend of Jeong Se-yeon,

22:58.627 --> 23:00.045
and the son of Lee Ju-hun.

23:00.128 --> 23:02.005
Why does he have so many secrets?

23:04.549 --> 23:06.551
Is he not on good terms with his dad?

23:07.135 --> 23:08.762
Is that why he said
he didn't have a family?

23:09.387 --> 23:10.388
Whatever.

23:10.472 --> 23:13.100
Why should I care
when he all but cut ties with me?

23:16.436 --> 23:17.729
Stop worrying about him.

23:19.606 --> 23:21.024
To prevent blood from clotting,

23:21.108 --> 23:23.110
you have to quickly get it onto the glass.

23:23.193 --> 23:24.444
- Yes.
- Yes.

23:24.528 --> 23:26.154
Make sure to put the cover slip on.

23:26.238 --> 23:27.072
- Yes.
- Yes.

23:27.656 --> 23:31.243
First, check with your eyes
if the color has changed.

23:31.326 --> 23:35.122
Observe the cell's distortion
using a microscope next.

23:35.205 --> 23:36.498
- Yes.
- Yes.

23:36.581 --> 23:37.791
Ju-kyung, look at this.

24:18.957 --> 24:19.875
Let go.

24:23.753 --> 24:24.796
I said, let go.

24:25.380 --> 24:27.716
You can just say it.
You don't have to grab me.

24:27.799 --> 24:29.759
I have nothing to say, so let me…

24:37.309 --> 24:39.144
What's with you guys? Did you fight?

25:00.165 --> 25:02.792
Ju-kyung, are you free after school?

25:06.796 --> 25:09.299
I feel so much better
after this rich drink.

25:09.382 --> 25:10.425
Thanks, Go-un.

25:11.051 --> 25:13.136
I wanted to treat you to something nicer.

25:13.220 --> 25:15.013
This is great. I didn't even do much.

25:16.348 --> 25:19.100
"Your language is foul,
so I figured it needed cleaning."

25:20.310 --> 25:21.519
Don't you remember?

25:21.603 --> 25:24.856
I'm so grateful for that day
and the day of the festival.

25:25.649 --> 25:27.025
I'm so glad to see you happy.

25:27.108 --> 25:30.737
By the way,
did they leave you alone after that?

25:31.488 --> 25:33.323
They talk behind my back.

25:33.406 --> 25:36.243
They say that I wore a bunch of makeup
to get myself on stage

25:36.326 --> 25:39.162
and that I must have a huge ego
not to wear makeup again.

25:40.413 --> 25:42.540
Don't those comments hurt you?

25:42.624 --> 25:44.918
If I started hating my face
because of their words,

25:45.001 --> 25:48.463
I'd be accepting it as a fact
that I'm ugly.

25:49.422 --> 25:51.591
So I decided to ignore whatever they say

25:51.675 --> 25:53.009
and live as myself.

25:56.096 --> 25:58.682
You are so awesome.

26:01.476 --> 26:05.647
Why does the thought
of living as myself scare me?

26:06.982 --> 26:08.525
I'm so lame.

26:09.359 --> 26:10.735
Right, Ju-kyung.

26:10.819 --> 26:13.571
Can you teach me how to do my makeup?

26:14.281 --> 26:15.365
Makeup?

26:15.991 --> 26:17.325
Obviously,

26:18.076 --> 26:19.619
men look their best when…

26:27.877 --> 26:28.712
Let's get to it.

26:55.613 --> 26:57.073
What? You were home?

26:58.867 --> 27:01.202
Please wear some clothes around the house.

27:05.498 --> 27:06.499
You're here.

27:22.474 --> 27:23.308
Well…

27:23.391 --> 27:25.185
Hey, I didn't see anything!

27:25.935 --> 27:26.770
I mean it!

27:32.734 --> 27:33.568
Seriously?

27:34.319 --> 27:35.445
Man, seriously?

27:38.698 --> 27:41.284
I told him not to. Serves him right.

27:42.202 --> 27:44.454
My little brother is the same way at home.

27:45.455 --> 27:47.248
He's actually in the same grade as you.

27:47.332 --> 27:49.125
Do you know Lim Ju-young by any chance?

27:49.209 --> 27:51.002
No. He must be in a different class.

27:51.086 --> 27:52.337
You don't need to know him.

27:52.837 --> 27:54.339
He's a nobody.

27:54.923 --> 27:56.591
Thank you so much for today.

27:56.674 --> 27:57.759
Don't mention it.

27:57.842 --> 27:59.302
No need to see me off. Bye!

28:00.762 --> 28:02.263
Take care, Ju-kyung!

28:06.935 --> 28:08.144
Is she leaving?

28:11.398 --> 28:12.440
Ju-kyung!

28:13.858 --> 28:15.068
Ju-kyung.

28:17.362 --> 28:18.905
I'm sorry.

28:18.988 --> 28:20.323
You, seriously…

28:20.907 --> 28:23.368
Are you resorting to hair-pulling now?

28:23.451 --> 28:24.285
Then…

28:24.786 --> 28:26.287
you should've stopped when I called.

28:27.288 --> 28:28.665
What do you want?

28:28.748 --> 28:29.582
What?

28:30.917 --> 28:31.751
Just because.

28:32.335 --> 28:33.169
Just because?

28:34.421 --> 28:36.464
- Let's go. I'll walk you.
- No thanks.

28:36.548 --> 28:38.466
It's a short bus ride, so there's no need.

28:38.550 --> 28:41.678
I never said I'd walk you to your home.
I meant to the bus stop.

28:41.761 --> 28:44.264
I know where it is. Go home.

28:45.140 --> 28:47.225
I'm grateful for your care of Go-un.

28:47.308 --> 28:48.518
I can't just go home.

28:49.102 --> 28:50.437
What did you just say?

28:51.229 --> 28:52.439
- What?
- You're what?

28:53.273 --> 28:54.190
What?

28:54.274 --> 28:55.650
You just said you're grateful.

28:56.693 --> 28:57.736
Did I?

28:58.319 --> 29:00.405
I never expected to hear
those words from you.

29:00.488 --> 29:01.948
Say it clearly, one more time.

29:02.031 --> 29:03.408
I'm not going to say it again.

29:03.491 --> 29:04.325
You heard me.

29:04.409 --> 29:05.785
I didn't get to hear it right.

29:10.665 --> 29:11.791
I'm sorry.

29:13.126 --> 29:13.960
You're sorry?

29:14.043 --> 29:15.378
I'm not going to repeat it.

29:19.174 --> 29:20.091
Hey,

29:21.009 --> 29:22.135
I'm the one who's sorry.

29:24.304 --> 29:25.847
- What for?
- Actually…

29:27.098 --> 29:28.099
I saw everything.

29:28.683 --> 29:29.559
You saw what?

29:30.852 --> 29:32.187
Your boxers.

29:34.189 --> 29:35.190
Roar!

29:36.524 --> 29:38.401
Hey, you said you didn't see anything!

29:44.449 --> 29:46.701
Hey there. I haven't seen you in a while.

29:48.036 --> 29:50.705
I haven't seen Ju-bal either.
Are you all taking midterms?

29:54.334 --> 29:55.460
Lim Ju-kyung!

29:55.543 --> 29:58.213
I know you're here reading comics
instead of studying!

30:00.131 --> 30:00.965
Goodness.

30:01.508 --> 30:02.634
Aren't you Soo-ho?

30:02.717 --> 30:03.760
What's with your voice?

30:15.522 --> 30:17.190
Mom, I'm home.

30:18.191 --> 30:19.400
I feel much better now.

30:19.943 --> 30:22.737
Dad, I'm hungry. Can you fix me something?

30:22.821 --> 30:24.697
You're home, sweetie?

30:29.828 --> 30:30.662
Mom.

30:31.746 --> 30:32.914
The person next to you…

30:33.790 --> 30:35.291
is that Lee Soo-ho?

30:36.167 --> 30:37.335
Silly girl.

30:37.418 --> 30:38.711
It's Soo-ho all right.

30:38.795 --> 30:40.004
And not a sculpture.

30:41.464 --> 30:42.549
Darn it!

30:48.221 --> 30:50.098
Mom, why would you bring him home?

30:50.181 --> 30:52.016
I wanted to fix a nice dinner

30:52.100 --> 30:54.060
for a classmate of my daughter.

30:54.143 --> 30:55.937
Mom, do you hate me or something?

30:56.020 --> 30:57.605
Why would you do this to me?

30:58.857 --> 30:59.691
Try it.

31:01.526 --> 31:03.027
Gosh, I like Dad's better.

31:09.784 --> 31:10.785
Soo-ho,

31:11.411 --> 31:14.372
would you say you're a friend of Ju-kyung

31:14.455 --> 31:16.457
or her boyfriend?

31:16.541 --> 31:18.084
We're not close at all.

31:18.167 --> 31:19.711
I wouldn't say we're friends.

31:19.794 --> 31:21.212
Why would you ask such a thing?

31:22.630 --> 31:23.715
Is that right?

31:24.299 --> 31:29.178
Then I hope you keep it that way, Soo-ho.

31:29.262 --> 31:31.264
Hey, aren't you busy today?

31:32.974 --> 31:33.892
I'm not busy at all.

31:34.976 --> 31:37.270
What are you talking about?
You have academy today.

31:37.353 --> 31:39.272
What? Academy?

31:39.981 --> 31:40.857
It's not today.

31:41.858 --> 31:43.026
Right?

31:43.735 --> 31:45.361
You must be hungry, Soo-ho.

31:45.445 --> 31:47.530
Honey, bring out the table with Ju-young.

31:48.197 --> 31:50.283
We'll have a big meal
like it's a celebration.

31:50.366 --> 31:51.701
This is not a celebration.

31:52.827 --> 31:54.037
What are you doing?

31:54.120 --> 31:56.497
Sitting there like a wet blanket.

31:59.834 --> 32:00.877
What?

32:11.930 --> 32:15.391
You are not my older brother,
so I'll call you whatever.

32:16.309 --> 32:18.436
Hey, Mr. Lee Soo-ho.

32:19.520 --> 32:21.064
What is it, Mr. Lim Ju-young?

32:21.147 --> 32:23.983
Aren't you the guy who knows about
Ju-kyung's no-makeup face?

32:25.193 --> 32:26.319
I'd say so.

32:26.402 --> 32:28.029
Now that you've found her out,

32:28.613 --> 32:30.156
are you blackmailing her?

32:30.239 --> 32:31.449
That's not the case.

32:32.325 --> 32:37.497
She seems uncomfortable around you,
so why did you come to her place?

32:37.580 --> 32:38.957
Do you like her or something?

32:39.916 --> 32:40.792
That one's correct.

32:46.089 --> 32:47.048
Interesting.

32:48.383 --> 32:49.509
You're a funny guy.

32:49.592 --> 32:50.927
I see you've got jokes.

32:52.720 --> 32:57.600
But don't joke like that with her.
She might take it seriously and get hurt.

32:58.476 --> 33:01.479
From what I hear,
you're the one who hurts her.

33:02.230 --> 33:04.607
You treat her poorly and look down on her.

33:04.691 --> 33:05.692
Is that what she said?

33:07.402 --> 33:09.779
You must be her actual friend
to share that with you.

33:10.363 --> 33:12.407
I admit it. Guilty as charged.

33:14.450 --> 33:15.576
Hey, Mr. Lee Soo-ho,

33:16.452 --> 33:17.954
use your strength, won't you?

33:30.758 --> 33:32.135
This…

33:32.218 --> 33:35.179
This is the table I bought
when I married my husband.

33:37.181 --> 33:39.642
- I'm so sorry.
- No need to be sorry.

33:39.726 --> 33:42.812
I might not get married again,
but I can always get a new table.

33:48.818 --> 33:50.278
I'd like to give you a wrap.

33:50.361 --> 33:51.654
Here. Open your mouth.

33:52.488 --> 33:53.865
- Thank you.
- Go on.

33:57.827 --> 33:58.703
Is it good?

34:00.496 --> 34:03.666
We could've gotten beef instead of pork
if we weren't broke.

34:03.750 --> 34:07.295
Honey, they say that pork
is healthier than beef these days.

34:09.297 --> 34:10.339
Of course.

34:12.592 --> 34:14.177
Hey, put that down.

34:15.595 --> 34:18.514
Ju-kyung's personality needs some work,

34:18.598 --> 34:21.225
but now her grades
could also use a lot of work.

34:21.309 --> 34:23.227
Mom, you don't have to share everything.

34:23.311 --> 34:25.730
I hear you're the top student?

34:25.813 --> 34:27.732
Can you please help Ju-kyung out?

34:27.815 --> 34:29.901
- You should study with her.
- Yes.

34:29.984 --> 34:30.818
That is,

34:31.569 --> 34:33.946
not by yourselves, but as a group.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.698
Why would I study with him?

34:38.159 --> 34:38.993
Excuse me.

34:39.744 --> 34:41.079
This is the real deal, right?

34:41.662 --> 34:42.747
Can I try it on?

34:43.539 --> 34:45.708
You know. Just to see how it fits.

34:45.792 --> 34:47.251
- That brat.
- Come on.

34:47.919 --> 34:50.379
- If you like it, you can have it.
- Soo-ho!

34:50.463 --> 34:52.423
I would be forever grateful!

34:52.507 --> 34:54.592
- Hey, put it down.
- Seriously.

34:54.675 --> 34:56.594
Why do you keep poking me
with your dirty foot?

34:56.677 --> 34:59.097
- Let go, okay? Come on.
- Stop that.

34:59.180 --> 35:00.640
You little brats!

35:10.441 --> 35:11.526
Soo-ho's with us.

35:12.110 --> 35:14.487
Can we please enjoy the food in peace?

35:14.570 --> 35:16.447
Lim Ju-bal keeps poking me with her foot.

35:16.531 --> 35:18.783
- Lim Ju-young, let go.
- Stop poking me!

35:18.866 --> 35:21.035
Seriously? You really want to go there?

35:32.713 --> 35:34.799
Ju-kyung. Let's eat.

35:40.930 --> 35:42.932
Soo-ho, do you have a little brother?

35:43.975 --> 35:45.059
No, I don't.

35:45.560 --> 35:47.270
Then can I be your little brother?

35:47.353 --> 35:49.438
- I don't want to be hers anymore.
- Hey.

35:49.522 --> 35:51.023
I don't want to give my son away.

35:51.107 --> 35:53.734
But if I have to,
I'd give you my daughter.

35:54.235 --> 35:56.320
They're not even legal adults yet.

35:56.863 --> 35:58.906
I'm only kidding.
Don't take it so seriously.

35:59.574 --> 36:00.700
Anyway, Soo-ho.

36:00.783 --> 36:02.869
We have such deep connections with you.

36:02.952 --> 36:04.120
Excuse me?

36:04.203 --> 36:05.872
My eldest daughter
works at Move Entertainment,

36:05.955 --> 36:07.415
your dad's company.

36:08.583 --> 36:12.211
- I see.
- Right, let's grill these and clean it up.

36:12.295 --> 36:15.631
She used to work for a major company
and went to Move last year.

36:15.715 --> 36:17.383
She has always been so clever.

36:17.466 --> 36:21.095
Lee Ju-hun must be happy
to have an employee like her.

36:29.270 --> 36:30.646
I'm back.

36:34.901 --> 36:35.943
I'm home.

36:44.076 --> 36:45.244
I'm thirsty.

36:45.328 --> 36:46.704
Help yourself.

36:46.787 --> 36:47.747
There's no water.

36:49.123 --> 36:50.333
- She rarely drinks,
- Water.

36:50.416 --> 36:52.335
- but guess she did today.
- Where is it?

36:55.463 --> 36:57.173
Goodness, Hee-kyung!

36:57.256 --> 36:58.591
The power's out again.

36:58.674 --> 37:00.468
Gosh, this place is such a dump.

37:00.551 --> 37:02.220
We just need to find the circuit breakers.

37:02.303 --> 37:03.596
- Circuit what?
- Where's my phone?

37:04.889 --> 37:06.849
I'm sorry, Soo-ho.
Can you please step aside?

37:06.933 --> 37:08.059
- Sure.
- Thanks.

37:12.104 --> 37:13.689
What's this?

37:13.773 --> 37:15.608
- That's my foot.
- I see, your foot.

37:15.691 --> 37:18.819
- Why is the couch all the way up here?
- That's my butt, come on.

37:18.903 --> 37:20.279
Why are you hitting me?

37:21.906 --> 37:23.074
- What?
- My gosh.

37:23.157 --> 37:24.158
- Goodness!
- What is it?

37:24.825 --> 37:26.744
- I found it.
- Come on, why would you…

37:28.371 --> 37:29.372
Help us!

37:32.124 --> 37:33.209
- It hurts!
- Honey.

37:35.336 --> 37:37.004
What is this?

37:40.174 --> 37:41.300
Goodness!

37:42.301 --> 37:44.220
- Get off.
- My legs.

37:44.303 --> 37:45.388
I can't get up.

37:46.264 --> 37:47.098
I just can't.

37:47.181 --> 37:49.392
- Honey.
- Honey.

37:52.728 --> 37:53.980
Goodness gracious.

37:54.897 --> 37:57.066
I just want to disappear.

37:57.733 --> 37:58.818
Seriously.

38:00.903 --> 38:02.738
- Honey.
- My back.

38:09.829 --> 38:11.580
Why did you come with her?

38:11.664 --> 38:13.541
You should have just said you were busy.

38:13.624 --> 38:14.500
How could I?

38:15.084 --> 38:16.127
You're good at that.

38:17.712 --> 38:19.130
Being cold and distant…

38:20.047 --> 38:21.257
That's your specialty.

38:23.217 --> 38:25.344
Great job putting up with
the bothersome task.

38:25.428 --> 38:26.679
Bye.

38:32.810 --> 38:34.562
It's embarrassing. Seriously.

38:34.645 --> 38:35.855
Why are these here?

38:43.154 --> 38:44.071
Hey, Ju-kyung.

38:45.865 --> 38:46.699
Get up.

38:47.616 --> 38:48.451
What?

38:48.534 --> 38:49.994
How come you're still sleeping?

38:50.077 --> 38:52.538
I studied until dawn.

38:53.122 --> 38:54.373
How did that happen?

38:54.457 --> 38:56.667
You must be tired then.
Let's go to the sauna.

38:57.460 --> 39:00.046
I need to cleanse myself of alcohol
and clear my hangover.

39:00.129 --> 39:01.464
No. I don't feel like it.

39:01.547 --> 39:04.842
Why are you so down lately?
I'll get you something yummy. Come on.

39:04.925 --> 39:06.969
- I don't feel like eating.
- Really?

39:09.096 --> 39:10.473
Not even spicy chicken feet?

39:11.057 --> 39:11.891
Down.

39:12.391 --> 39:13.309
Down.

39:14.018 --> 39:14.977
Hurry up.

39:15.061 --> 39:16.604
- Some sweet rice drinks too.
- Sure.

39:16.687 --> 39:17.521
And eggs!

39:19.231 --> 39:20.775
Let's go over there.

39:21.400 --> 39:25.404
PINEWOOD SAUNA

39:28.991 --> 39:31.160
#SPALAND #SAUNA #EATINGSHOW
#SWEATING #HOT #EGGS

39:36.290 --> 39:38.459
This feels good.

39:42.046 --> 39:43.506
It's so hot.

39:43.589 --> 39:44.507
Gosh.

39:48.969 --> 39:50.596
Why is it so hot here?

39:54.016 --> 39:56.894
Gosh. Why did he have to turn up here?

40:07.196 --> 40:10.533
Isn't this the hottest place here?
I don't like it when it's too hot.

40:10.616 --> 40:13.494
Can you call yourself a man
when you can't even handle this?

40:14.120 --> 40:15.538
If you can't handle it,

40:16.414 --> 40:18.541
go out and get me some ice cream.

40:18.624 --> 40:20.042
What are you talking about?

40:20.126 --> 40:21.877
I can handle it. I just don't like it.

40:23.212 --> 40:25.256
- The loser treats the winner to eggs.
- Okay.

40:29.927 --> 40:32.096
Gosh, I can't handle this!

40:33.514 --> 40:35.766
Eggs and sweet rice drinks, please.

40:35.850 --> 40:37.601
- Eggs, and…
- Chicken feet too.

40:37.685 --> 40:39.854
Would you like them spicy?

40:54.452 --> 40:56.412
You're quite high-maintenance.

40:57.955 --> 40:59.248
I'm sorry.

41:01.292 --> 41:02.585
He was cute.

41:03.669 --> 41:06.130
Make it spicy enough
to burn the whole mouth.

41:14.013 --> 41:16.056
Please leave.

41:16.140 --> 41:18.017
I'm getting barbecued alive here.

41:19.059 --> 41:20.895
It's Saturday.
You're not meeting your girlfriend?

41:20.978 --> 41:21.812
Girlfriend?

41:22.563 --> 41:23.564
What girlfriend?

41:24.732 --> 41:26.859
"I'll only listen to you."

41:26.942 --> 41:28.527
You kidding? It's not like that.

41:28.611 --> 41:31.238
Why not? Give it a shot.

41:31.322 --> 41:32.823
Ju-kyung's really pretty.

41:33.407 --> 41:36.285
- Don't you think so?
- She's pretty? Are you blind?

41:36.869 --> 41:38.245
That punk.

41:38.329 --> 41:40.539
Open your eyes
and look at her again, okay?

41:43.083 --> 41:46.754
Hey. That lady hasn't been moving
since we got here.

41:48.047 --> 41:51.050
What if she passed out
because of the heat?

41:52.176 --> 41:54.303
Ma'am, are you all right?

41:54.386 --> 41:56.180
I'm not passed out.

41:56.263 --> 41:59.642
I've got aches all over my body,
so I'm just enjoying this sauna session.

42:00.893 --> 42:04.188
- It's so refreshing.
- You're an expert, ma'am.

42:04.271 --> 42:05.814
She really is an expert.

42:07.316 --> 42:08.234
Hey,

42:08.317 --> 42:11.320
in the face of an expert,
I think this match is pointless.

42:11.904 --> 42:13.656
I'm just going to get my ice cream.

42:17.201 --> 42:19.036
Get me some eggs, Kim Cho-rong!

42:20.329 --> 42:21.789
I can't stand it anymore either.

42:32.800 --> 42:34.635
Isn't it too hot?

42:35.135 --> 42:38.097
- You'll get something cheap, right?
- What would you like?

42:41.600 --> 42:42.601
Eggs.

42:43.477 --> 42:44.353
Hey.

42:44.436 --> 42:46.730
- Come have some chicken feet, Lim Ju--
- No!

42:50.651 --> 42:52.945
LEE JU-HUN

42:53.028 --> 42:55.072
- What? You met Lee Ju-hun?
- Yes.

42:55.948 --> 42:57.992
He must've been a feast for the eyes.

42:59.285 --> 43:00.327
What's that?

43:02.037 --> 43:03.372
Ju-kyung's report card?

43:06.959 --> 43:08.210
I mean,

43:08.294 --> 43:11.213
how can all three of your kids
be good students?

43:12.464 --> 43:14.008
If a girl is pretty,

43:17.261 --> 43:18.637
I mean, kind, that's enough.

43:20.806 --> 43:22.266
I'll be off then.

43:28.355 --> 43:31.900
Lee Ju-hun's autograph
should be handed down as an heirloom.

43:31.984 --> 43:33.944
Why did I get it on her report card

43:34.028 --> 43:36.030
so that my descendants
will see her grades?

43:39.700 --> 43:40.618
Welcome.

43:42.369 --> 43:43.746
Hello.

43:43.829 --> 43:45.623
Goodness. Mr. Han.

43:57.009 --> 43:59.762
#SPALAND #SAUNA #EATINGSHOW
#SWEATING #HOT #EGGS

44:00.929 --> 44:01.930
She's having fun.

44:10.230 --> 44:11.482
Please have a seat here.

44:11.565 --> 44:12.941
- Thank you.
- Sure.

44:48.852 --> 44:51.939
JEONG SE-YEON

44:55.150 --> 45:00.114
JEONG SE-YEON

45:11.208 --> 45:13.752
- Hey.
- Please answer your phone.

45:13.836 --> 45:15.963
- Where are your manners?
- Turn it off.

46:00.674 --> 46:03.635
Hey, no one would have recognized you
without any makeup.

46:03.719 --> 46:05.345
Did you have to run away like that?

46:06.013 --> 46:07.473
You never know.

46:08.599 --> 46:10.976
This must be how criminals feel
sneaking around.

46:11.059 --> 46:14.271
Thanks to you, I didn't get to enjoy
the sauna or the chicken feet.

46:14.354 --> 46:16.148
Hey. Let's go get some burgers.

46:16.982 --> 46:19.401
- Here's my card, so go get some.
- You go get them.

46:20.486 --> 46:22.446
What about the car? Hurry and go.

46:23.530 --> 46:26.074
- Then I'll have two.
- Sure.

46:31.121 --> 46:33.499
- You're going out wearing that?
- Yes.

46:36.335 --> 46:39.546
#SPALAND #SAUNA #EATINGSHOW
#SWEATING #HOT #EGGS

46:48.347 --> 46:49.473
She's really here.

46:55.229 --> 46:57.064
- Enjoy.
- Today is all right. You can eat today.

46:57.147 --> 46:59.900
- What?
- They say Han Seo-jun kicked your ass,

46:59.983 --> 47:01.944
and that the Shinhwa High guys
did the same.

47:02.027 --> 47:03.737
What? Who the hell…

47:05.656 --> 47:07.783
- I feel shitty.
- What are you going to have?

47:07.866 --> 47:09.660
Just get me whatever and come up.

47:10.244 --> 47:11.995
- So, then…
- Don't be like that.

47:12.621 --> 47:15.624
- Get me some french fries.
- Number 82, your order is ready.

47:16.333 --> 47:17.834
I'll have a regular burger,

47:17.918 --> 47:20.337
- Thank you.
- a premium, and an original burger for me.

47:20.420 --> 47:21.255
Then a premium…

47:21.338 --> 47:24.341
I left because of parking enforcement.
Get a cab home with my card.

47:27.886 --> 47:29.304
Lim Ju-kyung?

47:30.347 --> 47:31.473
Hey.

47:33.725 --> 47:35.018
It's been a while, Dumpling.

47:35.102 --> 47:36.353
You're still ugly.

47:36.436 --> 47:37.688
Didn't you get uglier?

47:38.272 --> 47:40.274
I'll get going.

47:41.233 --> 47:44.319
Hey, I'm not done.
Where do you think you're going?

47:46.196 --> 47:47.364
Where'd you transfer to?

47:49.032 --> 47:50.701
I moved to the countryside.

47:51.368 --> 47:53.203
I'm just visiting my relatives today.

47:53.287 --> 47:56.373
You know there's a rumor you left
because I bullied you, don't you?

47:57.916 --> 48:00.711
What have you been telling people?

48:01.295 --> 48:03.964
Why would you…

48:04.673 --> 48:06.842
make me out to be the bad guy?

48:07.676 --> 48:08.802
I didn't do that.

48:12.180 --> 48:13.765
That'll hurt.

48:17.227 --> 48:19.187
Hey, give me your number.

48:32.826 --> 48:33.994
My wallet.

48:36.121 --> 48:37.080
My student ID.

48:38.290 --> 48:40.917
- What an unconventional design.
- It's our lucky day.

48:41.001 --> 48:42.836
- So luxurious.
- Her taste hasn't changed.

49:10.822 --> 49:11.657
Here.

49:20.248 --> 49:21.291
Are you okay?

49:22.459 --> 49:23.377
Am I okay?

49:23.877 --> 49:24.753
Why?

49:25.754 --> 49:27.798
Did you help me again
because you pitied me?

49:27.881 --> 49:30.550
We're not even close,
so you could've just left.

49:30.634 --> 49:33.470
Who are you to get involved and help me?
It's embarrassing!

49:33.553 --> 49:35.347
- Ju-kyung.
- You warned me.

49:37.891 --> 49:39.976
When I got excited
thinking that we were close,

49:40.060 --> 49:41.436
you told me not to kid myself.

49:42.729 --> 49:44.815
You said it was bothersome and annoying.

49:45.941 --> 49:46.900
Ju-kyung.

49:46.983 --> 49:48.902
So I gave you your space.

49:49.820 --> 49:52.114
You drew a line first,
so why are you doing this?

49:52.864 --> 49:55.075
Why are you confusing me
by going back and forth?

49:55.867 --> 49:56.827
Ju-kyung.

50:00.205 --> 50:01.123
It was them, right?

50:04.459 --> 50:05.627
The ones who bullied you…

50:08.046 --> 50:09.297
before you transferred.

50:13.885 --> 50:15.178
You must've been so shocked.

50:20.142 --> 50:21.184
And scared, too.

50:44.791 --> 50:46.293
I think I just saw Soo-ho.

50:46.376 --> 50:47.502
- Soo-ho?
- Yes.

50:48.795 --> 50:49.671
What is it?

50:51.131 --> 50:53.049
- There's Kim Cho-rong.
- What?

50:55.343 --> 50:56.386
Not again.

50:56.470 --> 50:59.347
What are you talking about?
Let's go, I'm hungry.

50:59.431 --> 51:00.724
But it was him.

51:03.393 --> 51:04.227
Did he leave?

51:04.978 --> 51:05.896
What?

51:10.609 --> 51:11.526
No.

51:14.613 --> 51:15.530
Not yet.

51:17.115 --> 51:18.200
What do I do?

51:25.749 --> 51:26.750
It's okay.

51:29.628 --> 51:30.879
You'll be okay now.

52:00.659 --> 52:02.410
Get home safe without getting caught.

52:22.681 --> 52:25.392
- That place makes a great hot pot.
- It's not that place.

52:25.475 --> 52:27.310
- What are you talking about?
- Well.

52:27.894 --> 52:29.271
Take a look at this asshole.

52:29.354 --> 52:30.480
It's Han Seo-jun.

52:31.648 --> 52:33.275
Let's get burgers next time.

52:34.693 --> 52:35.527
Let's go.

52:36.027 --> 52:36.945
Hey,

52:37.571 --> 52:40.115
why do you run away every time you see me?

52:40.198 --> 52:42.951
Remember we used to hang out together?

52:43.034 --> 52:44.411
And now you're drawing a line?

52:45.245 --> 52:46.329
That hurts my feelings.

52:46.413 --> 52:48.582
Let's not make a scene, okay?

52:48.665 --> 52:51.376
All this pomp is totally intimidating.

52:53.753 --> 52:55.046
I'm sorry.

52:55.130 --> 52:56.840
I thought it was a garbage can.

52:58.925 --> 52:59.926
You want to die?

53:00.010 --> 53:02.012
Leave if you don't want to die yourself.

53:02.095 --> 53:04.848
I don't want to deal
with thugs like you anymore.

53:08.518 --> 53:11.313
- You little--
- Sung-yong, let's just go.

53:11.396 --> 53:13.690
What? You want to fight right here?

53:15.609 --> 53:16.693
When should we do it?

53:17.277 --> 53:18.153
Tell me.

53:18.945 --> 53:19.779
We'll see.

53:21.197 --> 53:22.282
Let's just go.

53:23.617 --> 53:24.451
Come on.

53:37.255 --> 53:39.132
Don't blink, Mr. Han.

53:44.846 --> 53:46.890
We'll leave it like that for 15 minutes.

53:47.474 --> 53:51.186
They might look awkward at first,
but they will look natural soon.

53:51.269 --> 53:55.523
A set of dark eyebrows on your face

53:55.607 --> 53:57.734
will be like the icing on the cake.

53:58.318 --> 53:59.235
Thank you.

53:59.319 --> 54:01.112
It's raining outside, Mom.

54:01.196 --> 54:02.072
What?

54:06.284 --> 54:07.243
Mr. Han Jun-woo?

54:08.828 --> 54:09.704
Ms. Lim Hee-kyung?

54:11.790 --> 54:12.832
Mr. Han,

54:13.333 --> 54:16.086
are you acquainted
with my eldest daughter?

54:16.169 --> 54:18.004
- Yes, no?
- No?

54:19.130 --> 54:19.965
"Eldest daughter"?

54:21.007 --> 54:22.759
- Ju-kyung's older sister?
- Yes.

54:25.762 --> 54:27.555
My shoes.

54:27.639 --> 54:29.224
Do you need your shoes?

54:29.307 --> 54:30.600
- Hey!
- What?

54:31.726 --> 54:33.353
Why? What's wrong, Jun-woo?

54:33.436 --> 54:34.896
- Goodbye.
- What?

54:34.980 --> 54:37.107
Where are you going? Jun-woo!

54:39.359 --> 54:40.527
Jun-woo!

54:45.031 --> 54:46.032
Jun-woo!

54:55.792 --> 54:56.960
I got you.

55:01.923 --> 55:03.633
You might catch a cold. Take this.

55:12.017 --> 55:14.436
- What are you doing?
- You're getting drenched.

55:14.519 --> 55:15.729
You take it.

55:15.812 --> 55:17.313
I'm all right. Just take it home.

55:17.397 --> 55:19.566
No. You'll get all wet.

55:20.150 --> 55:22.318
You're getting wet now. Come here.

55:35.165 --> 55:36.583
I can't take it anymore.

55:38.001 --> 55:39.836
I'm going to do something naughty.

55:42.088 --> 55:43.548
Run away if you're scared.

56:08.031 --> 56:08.948
Get home safe!

56:11.242 --> 56:13.328
Please answer when I call you!

56:58.498 --> 57:00.083
The passcode has been verified.

57:20.812 --> 57:25.358
JS: WE'LL MAKE IT ONE DAY! LET'S GO!
HAN SEO-JUN

58:23.708 --> 58:24.542
Se-yeon…

58:26.085 --> 58:27.170
What do I do?

58:37.764 --> 58:39.098
Lee Sung-yong, what a psycho.

58:39.182 --> 58:41.184
Why is he calling me nonstop
since yesterday?

58:45.939 --> 58:46.773
Lim Ju-kyung?

58:48.775 --> 58:50.944
Wait, I was there too.

58:55.073 --> 58:56.533
Someone's pretending to be cute.

59:00.703 --> 59:04.207
Tarzan is wearing ten-won boxers

59:06.125 --> 59:07.001
Roar!

59:21.099 --> 59:21.975
Roar!

59:38.074 --> 59:42.078
- Please! Come on.
- Turn it.

59:42.161 --> 59:43.204
What's it going to be?

59:45.331 --> 59:47.000
- Hey, I bet on you!
- He's so good.

59:47.083 --> 59:50.211
- Hey, move. How did you…
- You need the right angle.

59:50.295 --> 59:51.129
Hey.

59:51.629 --> 59:54.173
I skipped school for you.
Are you really not coming?

59:55.091 --> 59:57.010
Let me have this game. Just one more.

59:57.093 --> 59:58.678
You just said that earlier.

59:58.761 --> 01:00:01.431
It'll be over soon.
Just sit down and wait a second, okay?

01:00:01.514 --> 01:00:03.182
Is Han Seo-jun still not picking up?

01:00:03.266 --> 01:00:05.685
He's ignoring me. That arrogant punk.

01:00:10.315 --> 01:00:11.274
Hey, look.

01:00:12.317 --> 01:00:13.693
- Hey! This is crazy.
- Damn it.

01:00:13.776 --> 01:00:15.570
I know who Seo-jun's girlfriend is.

01:00:15.653 --> 01:00:16.487
What?

01:00:17.864 --> 01:00:19.115
Her name is Lim Ju-kyung.

01:00:23.286 --> 01:00:24.120
Lim Ju-kyung?

01:00:25.997 --> 01:00:27.415
This girl is also Lim Ju-kyung.

01:00:29.334 --> 01:00:30.543
This is ridiculous.

01:00:30.627 --> 01:00:32.295
How do she and Dumpling
have the same name…

01:00:34.881 --> 01:00:36.716
- They're the same.
- She's really pretty.

01:00:36.799 --> 01:00:40.053
Hey, this is Han Seo-jun's girlfriend?

01:00:40.136 --> 01:00:40.970
Really?

01:00:45.308 --> 01:00:46.517
That's crazy.

01:00:47.143 --> 01:00:49.062
I guess strange coincidences happen.

01:00:49.145 --> 01:00:50.229
Lim Ju-kyung?

01:00:50.313 --> 01:00:51.314
So pretty.

01:00:54.901 --> 01:00:56.194
So today…

01:01:02.283 --> 01:01:04.744
- Work hard on your classes.
- What?

01:01:04.827 --> 01:01:05.870
- Sir?
- Excuse me?

01:01:07.664 --> 01:01:09.123
Today's absentee is Soo-ho…

01:01:09.207 --> 01:01:11.000
Soo-ho is absent today.

01:01:11.084 --> 01:01:12.126
So that's it.

01:01:12.710 --> 01:01:15.797
- What? Excuse me?
- What was that?

01:01:15.880 --> 01:01:17.840
No touching quotes today?

01:01:17.924 --> 01:01:20.009
Maybe he ran out of those.

01:01:20.093 --> 01:01:22.804
- Maybe he needed the bathroom?
- Speaking of, I need to go.

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:24.639
- What are you saying?
- Hey.

01:01:25.348 --> 01:01:26.599
Did you just…

01:01:27.225 --> 01:01:28.851
- What's going on?
- It's not that…

01:01:29.435 --> 01:01:30.395
Absent?

01:01:32.355 --> 01:01:33.189
What is it?

01:01:34.190 --> 01:01:35.525
What's up with Soo-ho?

01:01:40.113 --> 01:01:43.032
What's up, Soo-ho? Did something come up?

01:02:09.350 --> 01:02:11.185
How come you didn't come…

01:02:15.481 --> 01:02:17.316
You're doing okay, right?

01:02:23.322 --> 01:02:24.866
Get me melon ice cream.

01:02:25.450 --> 01:02:27.827
This punk keeps sending me on errands!

01:02:35.418 --> 01:02:39.213
Last time, your creatinine levels were up,
but they've gone down now.

01:02:39.297 --> 01:02:41.090
The other levels seem good too.

01:02:41.966 --> 01:02:44.093
I'll reduce the dosage
of your prescription.

01:02:44.177 --> 01:02:45.011
Thank you.

01:02:45.595 --> 01:02:46.554
What a relief.

01:02:47.221 --> 01:02:49.932
- That's great, Mom.
- See? I told you not to worry.

01:02:50.933 --> 01:02:51.768
Thank you.

01:02:51.851 --> 01:02:53.603
Save your thanks for Professor Kang.

01:02:54.312 --> 01:02:56.147
Your son's friend asked him a favor,

01:02:56.230 --> 01:02:58.775
so he put all the best staff here
on your case.

01:02:59.358 --> 01:03:00.443
My friend?

01:03:00.526 --> 01:03:02.612
I just need to see him really quick.

01:03:02.695 --> 01:03:04.739
I told you he's in surgery right now.

01:03:04.822 --> 01:03:06.199
And you need to schedule an--

01:03:06.282 --> 01:03:07.825
- I only need a minute…
- Please…

01:03:07.909 --> 01:03:08.785
What's going on?

01:03:33.226 --> 01:03:35.436
LIM JU-KYUNG SENT YOU A PICTURE

01:03:45.446 --> 01:03:46.739
What a goofball.

01:03:50.326 --> 01:03:52.245
I should have checked before hitting send.

01:03:53.037 --> 01:03:54.664
It's so embarrassing.

01:03:55.581 --> 01:03:56.874
I'm so stupid.

01:03:56.958 --> 01:03:58.000
MY FRIEND SU-AH

01:03:58.084 --> 01:03:59.877
I'm almost there.

01:03:59.961 --> 01:04:01.462
I'll save you a seat.

01:04:12.306 --> 01:04:13.599
Hi, Lim Ju-kyung.

01:04:14.267 --> 01:04:15.852
How have you been?

01:04:17.311 --> 01:04:19.522
Of course, we covered this side too.

01:04:19.605 --> 01:04:20.648
Did we startle you?

01:04:23.609 --> 01:04:24.944
Hey, where are you going?

01:04:30.074 --> 01:04:33.202
It was the first time Soo-ho came
to see me after his mom passed away.

01:04:33.286 --> 01:04:37.623
He told me it was his friend's mom
and tearily begged me to save her.

01:04:46.257 --> 01:04:47.091
What is it?

01:04:47.675 --> 01:04:48.509
You.

01:04:49.260 --> 01:04:50.887
Do you know Professor Kang?

01:04:52.221 --> 01:04:53.389
Who told you?

01:04:54.765 --> 01:04:55.808
Why did you do it?

01:05:01.856 --> 01:05:05.067
Did you think I'd come crying
to thank you if I found out?

01:05:05.151 --> 01:05:07.236
Was that what you were expecting
when you pulled this?

01:05:08.446 --> 01:05:09.906
Wouldn't you have done the same?

01:05:11.157 --> 01:05:13.367
- What?
- If we'd switched places,

01:05:14.785 --> 01:05:17.038
wouldn't you have done
the same for my mom?

01:05:18.664 --> 01:05:20.082
You were once my friend.

01:05:21.208 --> 01:05:22.251
That's why I did it.

01:05:23.502 --> 01:05:25.546
If you are so upset about my helping you,

01:05:26.714 --> 01:05:27.924
just forget about it.

01:05:28.925 --> 01:05:30.176
Problem solved.

01:05:32.011 --> 01:05:33.054
Hey, Soo-ho.

01:05:35.514 --> 01:05:36.724
What is it, Lim Ju-kyung?

01:05:40.394 --> 01:05:41.395
Hey, Seo-jun.

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:44.148
You're quick to pick up
your girlfriend's call.

01:05:46.734 --> 01:05:49.362
Seo-jun, I'll be waiting for you.
Hurry up.

01:05:50.154 --> 01:05:51.447
I miss you.

01:05:52.365 --> 01:05:55.534
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:05:55.618 --> 01:05:59.664
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:05:59.747 --> 01:06:01.624
- I believed in love
- I believed in love

01:06:01.707 --> 01:06:03.668
- But I was betrayed…
- But I was betrayed…

01:06:06.420 --> 01:06:07.588
What is it?

01:06:08.631 --> 01:06:09.799
Damn it.

01:06:10.883 --> 01:06:12.051
I said, what is it?

01:06:19.767 --> 01:06:22.061
What's up with Limju?
She said she was almost here.

01:06:22.895 --> 01:06:24.480
Obviously, she skipped class.

01:06:24.563 --> 01:06:26.607
Hey, Ju-kyung's not the type to do that.

01:06:26.691 --> 01:06:28.317
The person you are trying to reach…

01:06:28.401 --> 01:06:30.569
She's not even picking up.
Did something happen?

01:06:30.653 --> 01:06:32.488
- What are you doing?
- What are you doing?

01:06:32.571 --> 01:06:37.702
- What the heck are you doing here…
- What the heck are you doing here…

01:06:38.452 --> 01:06:40.997
What do you want to do
until your boyfriend comes?

01:06:41.664 --> 01:06:42.665
I…

01:06:43.165 --> 01:06:45.084
don't have a boyfriend.

01:06:45.668 --> 01:06:47.420
I see. You don't have one.

01:06:49.547 --> 01:06:50.881
Let's go, come on.

01:06:52.925 --> 01:06:56.595
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:06:56.679 --> 01:07:00.182
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:07:00.266 --> 01:07:02.727
- I couldn't believe my eyes
- I couldn't believe my eyes

01:07:02.810 --> 01:07:04.812
- I did a double take
- I did a double take

01:07:05.396 --> 01:07:07.815
- It's you, oh my, it's you
- It's you, oh my, it's you

01:07:07.898 --> 01:07:11.193
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:07:11.277 --> 01:07:15.072
- Why are you coming out of there?
- Why are you coming out of there?

01:07:15.156 --> 01:07:17.408
- I believed in love
- I believed in love

01:07:17.491 --> 01:07:20.578
- But I was betrayed…
- But I was betrayed…

01:07:26.959 --> 01:07:29.295
What is it, Limju?
Are you in a karaoke room?

01:07:29.378 --> 01:07:30.379
What?

01:07:30.963 --> 01:07:32.715
If you're going to karaoke,
you should have--

01:07:32.798 --> 01:07:33.632
Hey.

01:07:34.133 --> 01:07:35.760
I think they're delinquents.

01:07:37.344 --> 01:07:39.472
What? Are they stealing her money?

01:07:40.056 --> 01:07:41.140
Where is this place?

01:07:42.725 --> 01:07:45.311
Wait, I think I've been there before.

01:07:49.732 --> 01:07:52.068
KARAOKE

01:08:25.351 --> 01:08:27.895
Who's this guy?
You're not who we're waiting for.

01:08:27.978 --> 01:08:29.063
Ju-kyung.

01:08:29.855 --> 01:08:30.731
Soo-ho?

01:08:32.691 --> 01:08:34.443
Right, I remember.

01:08:34.527 --> 01:08:37.196
- It's the punk who followed us last time.
- That's right.

01:08:37.279 --> 01:08:38.197
Hey, you.

01:08:40.324 --> 01:08:41.659
Hey, what the heck?

01:08:42.660 --> 01:08:44.203
Hurry and get him.

01:08:44.286 --> 01:08:45.579
Hey, hold him!

01:08:50.084 --> 01:08:51.585
- Hey!
- It's Han Seo-jun.

01:08:51.669 --> 01:08:53.212
- Seo-jun's here.
- Go get him.

01:08:53.295 --> 01:08:54.713
- Jeez.
- Get him.

01:08:57.133 --> 01:08:58.384
- Hey, get him!
- Grab him.

01:08:58.467 --> 01:09:00.469
Soo-ho, are you crazy?

01:09:07.226 --> 01:09:08.060
You punk.

01:09:09.478 --> 01:09:10.604
- Hey.
- You come here.

01:09:10.688 --> 01:09:12.022
Hey, what the heck?

01:09:12.106 --> 01:09:13.399
This asshole.

01:09:15.151 --> 01:09:15.985
Hey!

01:09:25.953 --> 01:09:26.912
Over here.

01:09:30.416 --> 01:09:31.792
Are you okay?

01:09:35.838 --> 01:09:37.214
Are you okay? You're not hurt?

01:09:41.802 --> 01:09:44.180
- Who are these people?
- Who are these guys?

01:09:46.307 --> 01:09:47.766
AMOR FATI

01:09:47.850 --> 01:09:49.268
- Hey!
- Get up!

01:09:49.351 --> 01:09:51.187
- Is he dead?
- Guys, let's go.

01:09:56.275 --> 01:09:57.401
You stupid punk.

01:10:03.782 --> 01:10:05.451
- Take her.
- Come here!

01:10:06.160 --> 01:10:07.036
Su-ah!

01:10:10.039 --> 01:10:11.749
Tae-hoon!

01:10:11.832 --> 01:10:12.833
Hey!

01:10:17.171 --> 01:10:18.547
I like to stick to one target.

01:10:18.631 --> 01:10:20.132
Why does it have to be me?

01:11:27.491 --> 01:11:29.326
It feels like my heart is going to burst.

01:11:30.536 --> 01:11:31.704
What do I do?

01:11:31.787 --> 01:11:33.539
That looks painful.

01:11:34.206 --> 01:11:35.291
How did this happen?

01:11:36.041 --> 01:11:37.376
Thank you.

01:11:39.420 --> 01:11:42.381
- Give me your number.
- Number, number!

01:11:42.464 --> 01:11:44.550
I came in case Ju-kyung would come.

01:11:44.633 --> 01:11:45.467
I was worried.

01:11:46.510 --> 01:11:47.553
Where are you going?

01:11:49.388 --> 01:11:51.390
Do you want to go on a date with me?

01:11:53.142 --> 01:11:58.147
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
